msgid ""
"NPU 常见问题解答\n"
"================\n"
""
msgstr ""
"NPU FAQ\n"
"=========\n"
""

msgid ""
"本文档总结了在 NPU 上执行 VERL 训练和推理时遇到的常见问题及解决方案。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"This document summarizes common issues and solutions encountered when running VERL training and inference on NPUs.\n"
""

msgid ""
"环境配置问题\n"
"------------\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Environment Configuration Issues\n"
"--------------------------------\n"
""

msgid ""
"### Q1： NPU 设备不可见怎么办？\n"
""
msgstr ""
"### Q1: What should I do if the NPU device is not visible?\n"
""

msgid ""
"**问题现象**：torch_npu.npu.is_available() 返回 False\n"
""
msgstr ""
"**Symptom**: torch_npu.npu.is_available() returns False\n"
""

msgid ""
"**解决方案**：\n"
""
msgstr ""
"**Solution**:\n"
""

msgid ""
"   # 检查设备可见性\n"
"   echo $ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES\n"
""
msgstr ""
"# Check device visibility\n"
"echo $ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES\n"
""

msgid ""
"   # 设置可见设备并禁用ray自动设置\n"
"   export ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7\n"
"   export RAY_EXPERIMENTAL_NOSET_ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES=1\n"
""
msgstr ""
"# Set visible devices and disable Ray automatic device configuration\n"
"export ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7\n"
"export RAY_EXPERIMENTAL_NOSET_ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES=1\n"
""

msgid ""
"   # 检查驱动状态\n"
"   npu-smi info\n"
""
msgstr ""
"# Check the driver status\n"
"npu-smi info\n"
""

msgid ""
"调试和诊断\n"
"----------\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Debugging and Diagnosis\n"
"--------------------------\n"
""

msgid ""
"### Q1： 如何启用 NPU 性能分析？\n"
""
msgstr ""
"### Q1: How do I enable NPU performance profiling?\n"
""

msgid ""
"使用 VERL 内置的 profiler：\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Use the profiler built into VERL:\n"
""

msgid ""
"### Q2： 如何排查 NPU 训练失败的问题？\n"
""
msgstr ""
"### Q2: How do I troubleshoot NPU training failures?\n"
""

msgid ""
"**排查步骤**：\n"
""
msgstr ""
"**Troubleshooting steps**:\n"
""

msgid ""
"1. 检查环境变量配置\n"
"2. 验证设备可见性\n"
"3. 检查 CANN 版本兼容性\n"
"4. 查看日志中的具体错误信息\n"
"5. 使用最小化示例复现问题\n"
""
msgstr ""
"1. Check the environment variable configuration\n"
"2. Verify device visibility\n"
"3. Check CANN version compatibility\n"
"4. View the specific error messages in the logs\n"
"5. Reproduce the issue with a minimal example\n"
""

msgid ""
"**启用详细日志**：\n"
""
msgstr ""
"**Enable detailed logging**:\n"
""

msgid ""
"   # VERL 框架日志\n"
"   export VERL_LOGGING_LEVEL=DEBUG\n"
""
msgstr ""
"# VERL framework logging\n"
"export VERL_LOGGING_LEVEL=DEBUG\n"
""

msgid ""
"   # 昇腾 NPU 日志（0=DEBUG, 1=INFO, 2=WARNING, 3=ERROR）\n"
"   export ASCEND_GLOBAL_LOG_LEVEL=0\n"
"   export ASCEND_SLOG_PRINT_TO_STDOUT=1\n"
""
msgstr ""
"# Ascend NPU log (0=DEBUG, 1=INFO, 2=WARNING, 3=ERROR)\n"
"export ASCEND_GLOBAL_LOG_LEVEL=0\n"
"export ASCEND_SLOG_PRINT_TO_STDOUT=1\n"
""

msgid ""
"   # HCCL 通信日志\n"
"   export HCCL_DEBUG=INFO\n"
""
msgstr ""
"# HCCL Communication Log\n"
"export HCCL_DEBUG=INFO\n"
""

msgid ""
"常见错误信息\n"
"------------\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Common Error Messages\n"
"---------------------\n"
""

msgid ""
"**原因**：NPU 驱动未正确安装或设备不可见\n"
""
msgstr ""
"**Cause**: The NPU driver is not installed correctly or the device is not visible.\n"
""

msgid ""
"**解决方案**：检查驱动安装状态和 ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES 设置\n"
""
msgstr ""
"**Solution**: Check the driver installation status and the ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES setting.\n"
""

msgid ""
"**原因**：MindSpeed版本过低\n"
""
msgstr ""
"**Cause**: The MindSpeed version is too old.\n"
""

msgid ""
"**解决方案**：切换MindSpeed至 2.3.0_core_r0.12.1\n"
""
msgstr ""
"**Solution**: Switch MindSpeed to 2.3.0_core_r0.12.1\n"
""

msgid ""
"**问题现象**：在分布式训练权重同步时，出现如下错误：\n"
""
msgstr ""
"**Symptom**: The following error occurs during weight synchronization in distributed training:\n"
""

msgid ""
"**原因**：模型某个权重张量的大小超过了权重传输 bucket 的默认容量（2048 MB）。在 verl 框架中，模型权重通过 bucket（缓冲区）进行分块打包传输。当单个权重张量超过 bucket 大小时，断言检查失败。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"**Cause**: The size of a weight tensor in the model exceeds the default capacity of the weight transfer bucket (2048 MB). In the verl framework, model weights are packaged and transferred in chunks through buckets (buffers). When a single weight tensor exceeds the bucket size, the assertion check fails.\n"
""

msgid ""
"**权重大小计算方法**：\n"
""
msgstr ""
"**Weight Size Calculation Method**:\n"
""

msgid ""
"权重张量的内存占用（字节）= 各维度大小的乘积 × 每个元素的字节数\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Memory usage of the weight tensor (in bytes) = product of the sizes of each dimension × number of bytes per element\n"
""

msgid ""
"其中数据类型对应的字节数为：\n"
""
msgstr ""
"The number of bytes corresponding to each data type is as follows:\n"
""

msgid ""
"- ``torch.float32`` → 4 字节\n"
"- ``torch.float16`` / ``torch.bfloat16`` → 2 字节\n"
"- ``torch.int8`` → 1 字节\n"
""
msgstr ""
"- ``torch.float32`` → 4 bytes\n"
"- ``torch.float16`` / ``torch.bfloat16`` → 2 bytes\n"
"- ``torch.int8`` → 1 byte\n"
""

msgid ""
"以本例中的 ``model.embed_tokens.weight`` 为例：\n"
""
msgstr ""
"For example, take ``model.embed_tokens.weight`` from this example:\n"
""

msgid ""
"   张量形状: torch.Size([151936, 4096])\n"
"   数据类型: torch.float32 (4 字节)\n"
"   权重大小 = 151936 × 4096 × 4 = 2,483,027,968 字节 ≈ 2369 MB\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Tensor shape: torch.Size([151936, 4096])\n"
"Data type: torch.float32 (4 bytes)\n"
"Weight size = 151936 × 4096 × 4 = 2,483,027,968 bytes ≈ 2369 MB\n"
""

msgid ""
"   默认 bucket 大小 = 2048 MB < 2369 MB → 触发断言失败\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Default bucket size = 2048 MB < 2369 MB → triggers assertion failure\n"
""

msgid ""
"**解决方案**：在启动训练时增加 ``update_weights_bucket_megabytes`` 参数，使 bucket 容量大于最大权重张量的内存占用：\n"
""
msgstr ""
"**Solution**: When starting training, add the ``update_weights_bucket_megabytes`` parameter so that the bucket capacity exceeds the memory usage of the largest weight tensor:\n"
""

msgid ""
"**参数值选择建议**：\n"
""
msgstr ""
"**Parameter Value Selection Recommendations**:\n"
""

msgid ""
"1. **计算模型中最大权重张量的内存占用**：遍历模型所有参数，找出 ``nbytes`` 最大的那个，将其转换为 MB（除以 1024²）。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"1. **Memory usage of the largest weight tensor in the model**: Iterate through all model parameters, find the one with the largest ``nbytes``, and convert it to MB (divide by 1024²).\n"
""

msgid ""
"2. **向上取整到 2 的幂次**：为便于内存分配和管理，建议将计算结果向上取整到最近的 2 的幂次（如 2048、4096、8192 等）。例如最大权重为 2369 MB，则取 4096 MB。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"2. **Round up to a power of 2**: To facilitate memory allocation and management, it is recommended to round the calculation result up to the nearest power of 2 (for example, 2048, 4096, 8192, and so on). For example, if the maximum weight is 2369 MB, use 4096 MB.\n"
""

msgid ""
"3. **预留适当余量**：考虑到内存对齐和运行时开销，建议 bucket 大小至少为最大权重大小的 1.2~1.5 倍，再向上取整到 2 的幂次。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"3. **Reserve an appropriate margin**: Considering memory alignment and runtime overhead, set the bucket size to at least 1.2 to 1.5 times the size of the largest weight, and then round up to a power of 2.\n"
""

msgid ""
"4. **注意内存限制**：bucket 大小会直接影响 worker 节点的内存占用，设置过大会导致 OOM。应在满足权重传输需求的前提下，尽量选择较小的值。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"4. **Note the memory limit**: The bucket size directly affects the memory usage of worker nodes, and setting it too large can cause out-of-memory (OOM) errors. Choose the smallest value that still meets the weight transfer requirements.\n"
""

msgid ""
"**常见模型的推荐值**：\n"
""
msgstr ""
"**Recommended values for common models**:\n"
""

msgid ""
"   * - 模型规模\n"
"     - 典型最大权重形状\n"
"     - 推荐 bucket 大小\n"
"   * - 7B (Qwen2 等)\n"
"     - [151936, 4096] float32\n"
"     - 4096 MB\n"
"   * - 14B\n"
"     - [152064, 5120] float32\n"
"     - 4096 MB\n"
"   * - 72B\n"
"     - [152064, 8192] float32\n"
"     - 8192 MB\n"
""
msgstr ""
"* - Model scale\n"
"  - Typical maximum weight shape\n"
"  - Recommended bucket size\n"
"* - 7B (such as Qwen2)\n"
"  - [151936, 4096] float32\n"
"  - 4096 MB\n"
"* - 14B\n"
"  - [152064, 5120] float32\n"
"  - 4096 MB\n"
"* - 72B\n"
"  - [152064, 8192] float32\n"
"  - 8192 MB\n"
""

msgid ""
"### Q4： 非共享存储下 checkpoint 加载失败，找不到 common.pt / .metadata / metadata.json\n"
""
msgstr ""
"### Q4: Checkpoint loading fails under non-shared storage; common.pt / .metadata / metadata.json cannot be found\n"
""

msgid ""
"**问题现象**：使用 verl + Megatron 后端在**非共享存储**的多机环境下，保存 checkpoint 正常，但重新加载时报错，提示找不到以下文件：\n"
""
msgstr ""
"**Problem Symptom**: When using the verl + Megatron backend in a multi-node environment with **non-shared storage**, saving checkpoints works normally, but reloading fails with an error indicating that the following files cannot be found:\n"
""

msgid ""
"**原因**：当前 checkpoint 机制对非共享存储的支持不完善。具体表现为：\n"
""
msgstr ""
"**Cause**: The current checkpoint mechanism does not fully support non-shared storage. This is reflected in the following ways:\n"
""

msgid ""
"- **分布式训练权重是分节点保存的**，每个节点只保存自己负责的分片权重，不会只在主节点保存全部权重。\n"
"- 但 ``common.pt``、``.metadata``、``metadata.json`` 等元数据文件**仅保存在执行保存操作的节点上**（通常是 rank 0 所在节点），其他节点本地没有这些文件。\n"
"- 加载 checkpoint 时，每个节点都需要读取这些元数据文件来还原模型状态，但非共享存储下其他节点本地路径中不存在这些文件，导致加载失败。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"- **Distributed training weights are saved per node**, and each node saves only the weight shards it is responsible for; the full weights are not saved only on the main node.\n"
"- However, metadata files such as ``common.pt``, ``.metadata``, and ``metadata.json`` are **saved only on the node that performs the save operation** (usually the node where rank 0 is located), and other nodes do not have these files locally.\n"
"- When loading a checkpoint, each node needs to read these metadata files to restore the model state, but under non-shared storage, these files do not exist in the local paths of other nodes, causing the loading to fail.\n"
""

msgid ""
"**临时解决方案**：手动将元数据文件从保存节点复制到所有其他节点：\n"
""
msgstr ""
"**Temporary workaround**: Manually copy the metadata file from the saving node to all other nodes:\n"
""

msgid ""
"   # 假设 checkpoint 保存在 rank 0 节点的 /path/to/ckpt/ 目录下\n"
"   # 将元数据文件从 rank 0 节点复制到其他所有节点\n"
""
msgstr ""
"# Assume the checkpoint is saved in the /path/to/ckpt/ directory on the rank 0 node\n"
"# Copy the metadata file from the rank 0 node to all other nodes\n"
""

msgid ""
"   # 需要复制的文件\n"
"   /path/to/ckpt/common.pt\n"
"   /path/to/ckpt/.metadata\n"
"   /path/to/ckpt/metadata.json\n"
""
msgstr ""
"# Files to copy\n"
"/path/to/ckpt/common.pt\n"
"/path/to/ckpt/.metadata\n"
"/path/to/ckpt/metadata.json\n"
""

msgid ""
"   # 示例：使用 scp 复制到其他节点\n"
"   scp /path/to/ckpt/common.pt node1:/path/to/ckpt/\n"
"   scp /path/to/ckpt/.metadata node1:/path/to/ckpt/\n"
"   scp /path/to/ckpt/metadata.json node1:/path/to/ckpt/\n"
""
msgstr ""
"# Example: Using scp to copy to another node\n"
"scp /path/to/ckpt/common.pt node1:/path/to/ckpt/\n"
"scp /path/to/ckpt/.metadata node1:/path/to/ckpt/\n"
"scp /path/to/ckpt/metadata.json node1:/path/to/ckpt/\n"
""

msgid ""
"   # 对所有节点重复上述操作\n"
""
msgstr ""
"# Repeat the preceding steps for all nodes\n"
""

msgid ""
"**注意事项**：\n"
""
msgstr ""
"**Precautions**:\n"
""

msgid ""
"- 每次保存 checkpoint 后都需要重新复制元数据文件，因为保存操作可能会更新这些文件的内容。\n"
"- 如果训练过程中频繁保存 checkpoint（如按步数自动保存），建议编写脚本在保存后自动触发复制，避免遗漏。\n"
"- 长期方案应等待框架层面支持非共享存储的 checkpoint 加载，使元数据文件能自动同步到所有节点。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"- After each checkpoint save, you must copy the metadata files again, because the save operation can update the contents of these files.\n"
"- If checkpoints are saved frequently during training (for example, automatically by step), write a script to trigger the copy automatically after each save to avoid omissions.\n"
"- For a long-term solution, wait for framework-level support for loading checkpoints from non-shared storage, so that metadata files can be synchronized to all nodes automatically.\n"
""

